        normalized by their ``fsum``.
    Assuming the receptor errors within one scenario are mutually
    independent, returns ``Q`` where, with ``sigma = W[k][i]``:

    * ``q[j] = 0.5 * erfc((thresholds[j] - H[k][i]) / (sigma * sqrt(2)))``
